2. It verifies that `user_id` exists on `socket.data.user_id`.
3. It checks if `boardUsersMap.has(board_id)` returns true. If the board is not present in the map, the operation is rejected, and an `"error"` event with the message `"User is not connected to any board"` is emitted back through the socket.

